+/* macOS/D3DMetal cannot create NV12/planar D3D11 textures, so direct-IMFTransform
+ * consumers (UE ElectraPlayer) must get system-memory, IMF2DBuffer2-capable
+ * output and the decoder must advertise no D3D awareness.
